{
  "text": "Good morning Computex. Accelerated computing is here. For forty years, CPU scaling drove the computer industry. Moore's Law has ended. We are seeing diminishing returns from general-purpose CPUs. Accelerated computing and generative AI have emerged to drive the next wave of industrial productivity. Datacenters are no longer retrieving pre-recorded information. They are generating tokens in real-time. Datacenters have become AI factories. Every enterprise will build factories to produce artificial intelligence tokens.",
